{"id":"35c764f4e9f21f28","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-axiom-set.md","title":"Axiom Set","display":"df-axiom-set — Axiom Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-axiom-set","aliases":["92-df-axiom-set"],"display":"df-axiom-set — Axiom Set","depends_on":["[[92-df-formal-system]]"],"source":"本地算术语法；对照原书第 II 章 pp.14–19 和第 III 章 pp.28–30；本库 token 编码及 Hilbert 呈现与原书原生语言不同","source_status":"原书相关概念的本地语法实现"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-axiom-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-axiom-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-axiom-set — Axiom Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6a1ff87567369c3c\" href=\"?note=6a1ff87567369c3c\" title=\"92-df-formal-system\">92-df-formal-system</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"本地算术语法；对照原书第 II 章 pp.14–19 和第 III 章 pp.28–30；本库 token 编码及 Hilbert 呈现与原书原生语言不同"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书相关概念的本地语法实现"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-axiom-set-—-Axiom-Set-$\\mathrm{Ax}$\">df-axiom-set — Axiom Set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F}\">\\(\\mathcal{F}\\)</span> (formal system, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6a1ff87567369c3c\" href=\"?note=6a1ff87567369c3c\" title=\"92-df-formal-system\">92-df-formal-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FormalSys}\">\\(\\mathrm{FormalSys}\\)</span> (formal-system predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6a1ff87567369c3c\" href=\"?note=6a1ff87567369c3c\" title=\"92-df-formal-system\">92-df-formal-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}\\)</span> (definition-target projection)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}axiom\\text{-}set} \\vdash\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{Ax})\\coloneqq\\{\\mathcal F\\mid\\mathrm{FormalSys}(\\mathcal F)\\},\\qquad\n\\forall\\mathcal F\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{Ax})\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ax}(\\mathcal F)\\coloneqq\\pi_2(\\mathcal F)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}axiom\\text{-}set} \\vdash\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{Ax})\\coloneqq\\{\\mathcal F\\mid\\mathrm{FormalSys}(\\mathcal F)\\},\\qquad\n\\forall\\mathcal F\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{Ax})\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ax}(\\mathcal F)\\coloneqq\\pi_2(\\mathcal F)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}(\\mathcal{F})\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}(\\mathcal{F})\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F}\">\\(\\mathcal{F}\\)</span>的公理集</li>\n<li>公理是无需前提就可证的公式</li>\n<li>单元素序列<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\varphi)\">\\((\\varphi)\\)</span>是公理<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>的证明</li>\n<li>一般形式系统的公理集不必有效；“可判定”或“可枚举”是另加的有效性条件</li>\n<li>本书后续另行验证系统 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 的公理集具有所需的有效性</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-axiom-set-—-Axiom-Set-$\\mathrm{Ax}$","text":"df-axiom-set — Axiom Set $\\mathrm{Ax}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-formal-system","status":"resolved","id":"6a1ff87567369c3c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","